{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, leading daring combat missions deep into enemy territory.\u00a0 Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for  Marine landing forces. Engage in ship-to-ship combat, build bases on planet surfaces, and shred enemies with turrets and your assault rifle alike.\u00a0 Turn the tide in a war for humanity's survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien cruisers, and escort allied ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on hostile planets to safeguard against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Each planet has unique characteristics, but the objective is almost always the same: create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can resupply with unlimited materials to continue building.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Keep coming back to the planet to work on your base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Your Ship - Farm, Mine, Read, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the fight to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials for your next mission through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?\u00a0 Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.\u00a0 Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War, Unified Earth Forces ships, and other interesting topics. Earth will be an area for continued growth during Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8382ce516823a641514b047b30283641.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76e93f1cade6b0b433db9590b73505a0.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/222f3cbfebc13dd33bf8693673526f4e.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e67f12d236d4ea4dc5b55827503088db.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b4e25bfddb2e18eb2cc78b2b7c03afd1.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1454 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report to your ship and prepare for departure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/49598afb543e6e0e1c4600996a3eb827.avif?t=1774545521\" width=375 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819710?t=1774545521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/2acb4634c7fa4a873829bafb82c97067e1b4d4a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774545521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774545521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774545521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3887930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>As Seen On</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/edd57ff921517de2fe3e72912ce5f7b1.avif?t=1774545521\" width=396 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/df33067fe6f6c04acf7432c606f25be1.avif?t=1774545521\" width=396 height=86 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Demo Players Recommend Fortified Space</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To see what players said about the demo, visit its separate Steam page by clicking &quot;Learn More&quot; in the green banner above.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, leading daring combat missions deep into enemy territory.\u00a0 Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for  Marine landing forces. Engage in ship-to-ship combat, build bases on planet surfaces, and shred enemies with turrets and your assault rifle alike.\u00a0 Turn the tide in a war for humanity's survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien cruisers, and escort allied ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on hostile planets to safeguard against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Each planet has unique characteristics, but the objective is almost always the same: create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can resupply with unlimited materials to continue building.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Keep coming back to the planet to work on your base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Your Ship - Farm, Mine, Read, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the fight to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials for your next mission through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.poster.avif?t=1774545521\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.webm?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.mp4?t=1774545521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?\u00a0 Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.\u00a0 Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War, Unified Earth Forces ships, and other interesting topics. Earth will be an area for continued growth during Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8382ce516823a641514b047b30283641.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76e93f1cade6b0b433db9590b73505a0.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/222f3cbfebc13dd33bf8693673526f4e.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e67f12d236d4ea4dc5b55827503088db.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b4e25bfddb2e18eb2cc78b2b7c03afd1.avif?t=1774545521\" width=1454 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report to your ship and prepare for departure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/49598afb543e6e0e1c4600996a3eb827.avif?t=1774545521\" width=375 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nightsail Game Studios"],"dlc":[3887940],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/c5cff8bd316d2f9dfe97e46e1a8e97b1cb937af7/header.jpg?t=1774545521","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/99215877/b65cbdcd15c4cb01d14c6c4f38739876ef50913a/1773434297/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773434882","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/99215877/b65cbdcd15c4cb01d14c6c4f38739876ef50913a/1773434297/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773434882","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/99215877/b65cbdcd15c4cb01d14c6c4f38739876ef50913a/1773434297/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773434882","id":257303341,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257303341/4d687a9e2ca35660d85f2e8f1286af466d25bd8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773434882"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/1799841323/ab4cf146e1af354b444ad1cb08b269dda61701e4/1758847841/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758933759","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/1799841323/ab4cf146e1af354b444ad1cb08b269dda61701e4/1758847841/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758933759","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819710/1799841323/ab4cf146e1af354b444ad1cb08b269dda61701e4/1758847841/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758933759","id":257206448,"name":"Full Demo Playthrough with Developer Commentary","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206448/bc1bfdeba356eddb3d6e14c9c3893d08534656ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758933759"}],"name":"Fortified Space","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 4700U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nightsail Game Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"27 Mar, 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cFortified Space offers an unique blend within the strategy genre. The game alternates between intense space battles and surface missions where the objective changes completely\u2026this change of scenery is one of the game's most interesting ideas. [Translated from Spanish]\u201d<br>Kotaku (Espa\u00f1ol)<br><br>\u201cWhen one indie developer couldn\u2019t find the sci-fi game of his dreams, he built it himself...this is one of the most promising sci-fi indies of 2025.\u201d<br>Fix Gaming Channel<br><br>\u201cThe game's presentation was interesting; it has that charming sci-fi Newgrounds Flash feel, but updated in terms of broad gameplay and requiring a strategic approach to clear the objectives.\u201d<br>We Playtest Games<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/d5bf670eed8f931a88208d2a1d963217bdbce58e/ss_d5bf670eed8f931a88208d2a1d963217bdbce58e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774545521","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/